      "text": "What if this Spring bean doesn't exist?"
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "start": 1.992583,
      "end": 6.78475,
      "text": "A required audit publisher is missing. Spring cannot finish creating the service."
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 6.86475,
      "end": 12.379333,
      "text": "Change the constructor parameter to Optional of AuditPublisher. Now absence is allowed."
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 12.459333,
      "end": 17.675125,
      "text": "With one matching publisher, Spring supplies an Optional containing that managed instance."
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "start": 17.755125,
      "end": 23.774,
      "text": "With no publisher, Spring supplies an empty Optional. The service skips this extra notification."
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 23.854,
      "end": 32.839208,
      "text": "Both optional contexts start. Our tests confirm the values. Ambiguity can still fail. Keep critical security dependencies required."
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "start": 34.839208,
      "end": 35.929958,
      "text": "Thanks for watching."
    }
